  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> be an arbitrary point lying on a plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;which passes through the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>42</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo></math>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>42</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the value of expression&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is<gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></gwmw></p>"
