  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Plane passing through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>42</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>42</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>From intercept from, equation of plane is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>42</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now, given expression is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>42</mn><mrow><mn>14</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>"
